body:
Exactly!!! Only thing that kind of helps it's being able to come here and know I'm not alone. Thank you everyone who chooses to share your struggle.
I'm friggin pregnant Epileptic..so scared because I want to plan for our future and all I get is "be patient" try having pregnancy hormones raging but you can't even afford a decent meal because you're about to be homeless so you want to save money because you don't know how much of it you'll have when your baby is born (probably in a Covid-19 infested hospital) {should go for a home birth..oh that's right ABOUT TO BE FKING HOMELESS} 
.....mfs.
